Copied byte for byte from simonliu99/dota-replays tests/golden at commit 2cb42b6cfb5c18b0ebf5915475d77e6f4994a094 (the publisher's golden documents, D1 merge, dota-replays#28).

Each copied file's SHA-256, as `shasum -a 256` prints it, with its path under
tests/golden. dota-replays' tests compare its golden files with this list, and
switchboard's TestCopiedFixturesMatchTheirSource compares the copies here, so a
golden file regenerated on either side fails until both sides copy it again.

